Package: SpaMTPData
Type: Package
Title: Experiment Data Resources for SpaMTP Workflows
Version: 0.99.0
Date: 2026-08-14
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tianyao", "Lu",
           email = "lu.t@wehi.edu.au",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Andrew", "Causer", role = "aut"),
    person("Quan", "Nguyen", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Provides lightweight, version-aware access to spatial
    metabolomics and multi-omics experiment data used in SpaMTP workflows.
    Resources cover mouse brain, mouse urinary bladder, simulated single-cell
    multi-omics, annotation-refinement, and human brain examples. Large files
    are retrieved and cached through ExperimentHub rather than stored in the
    package repository.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
